# Context Budgets

Spec: ContextBudgets
Purpose:
  Limit context size and complexity per task risk level.

Budgets:
  LOW:
    max_refs: 20
    max_tokens: 8000
    max_layers: L0-L4

  MEDIUM:
    max_refs: 40
    max_tokens: 16000
    max_layers: L0-L6

  HIGH:
    max_refs: 80
    max_tokens: 30000
    max_layers: L0-L8

  CRITICAL:
    max_refs: 120
    max_tokens: 50000
    max_layers: L0-L10

Enforcement:
  If budget exceeded:
    1. Drop lowest-scored references first
    2. Preserve dependencies of kept references
    3. Document exclusions in manifest
    4. Set confidence to MEDIUM or LOW

Rules:
  [BDG-01] Budget MUST be enforced before context is returned.
  [BDG-02] Dependency references MUST be preserved over scored references.
  [BDG-03] Budget overrun MUST reduce confidence level.

